    <string name="quality_enhanced">Enhanced</string>
    <string name="quality_enhanced_goal">A living backdrop that moves with your music</string>
    <string name="quality_enhanced_feature_1">Now Playing sits on your cover as smooth coloured light, all the way to the screen\'s edge, on every Android version</string>
    <string name="quality_enhanced_feature_2">The backdrop drifts slowly, in Now Playing and across the whole app, and goes back to dark when nothing is playing</string>
    <string name="quality_enhanced_feature_3">A light field: three pools of the cover\'s own colours float across it, on every screen</string>
    <string name="quality_enhanced_feature_4">Edge light: the colour at each edge of the cover spills out behind it</string>
    <string name="quality_enhanced_feature_5">Colour from the cover: the waveform, the light around the art and its shadow match each song</string>
    <string name="quality_enhanced_feature_6">Reactive artwork, the kick: the cover moves like a speaker cone - out on each kick drum and back - and its glow and the rings it sends out move with it. The backdrop swells slowly with the bass</string>
    <string name="quality_enhanced_feature_7">Lyrics in focus: lines away from the one being sung go soft</string>
    <string name="quality_enhanced_feature_8">Sharper artwork, a 72-bar waveform, and fine grain that stops colour banding</string>
    <string name="quality_premium">Premium</string>
    <string name="quality_premium_goal">Artwork you can tilt, light that follows the beat</string>
    <string name="quality_premium_feature_1">Everything in Enhanced</string>
    <string name="quality_premium_feature_2">Parallax with depth: the cover tilts with your phone, light slides across it, and the backdrop moves behind it as its own layer</string>
    <string name="quality_premium_feature_3">The backdrop turns as it drifts, here and across the app, and a fourth pool joins the light field; with Reactive artwork the pools swell on the bass in Now Playing</string>
    <string name="quality_premium_feature_4">Reactive artwork adds the snare, as light: one flash across the cover on each snare, and the cover\'s shadow deepens as each kick pushes it out. Each drum has one job, so they never compete</string>
    <string name="quality_premium_feature_5">The sung lyric line glows</string>
    <string name="quality_premium_feature_6">Your screen\'s top refresh rate while Now Playing is open</string>
    <string name="quality_premium_feature_7">Full-resolution artwork, a 96-bar waveform</string>
    <string name="quality_ultra">Ultra</string>
    <string name="quality_ultra_goal">Your cover as liquid light</string>
    <string name="quality_ultra_feature_1">Everything in Premium</string>
    <string name="quality_ultra_feature_2">Fluid artwork: the cover\'s colours flow into one another like liquid, in Now Playing and across the whole app (Android 13 and later)</string>
    <string name="quality_ultra_feature_3">Reactive artwork adds the hi-hats, as texture: the cover deforms like a real speaker cone on the kick, a ripple runs across it, and its surface shimmers on the hats (Android 13 and later). The flow swells with the bass</string>
    <string name="quality_ultra_feature_4">A fifth pool of light in the light field</string>
    <string name="quality_ultra_feature_5">The finest waveform: 120 bars</string>
    <string name="quality_ultra_feature_6">Larger artwork in track lists</string>
